<title>USA: Luce Cty, Mich., won by McDonald.</title>
<headline>Luce Cty, Mich., won by McDonald.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>McDonald &amp; Company Sec, Inc., said it won $1.400 million of Luce Cty, Mich., 1996 general obligation bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.08 percent.</p>
